  <name>Tangent</name>
  <summary>Use the command line</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Tangent is a terminal built with GTK 4 and libadwaita. Its text is drawn by the GPU, pixel for pixel at any display scale.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Tabs with an overview, and new tabs and windows in the folder of the current one</li>
      <li>Search through the history, selection by word or line, and addresses opened with Ctrl and a click</li>
      <li>Mouse reporting, bracketed paste, true colour, and underline styles</li>
      <li>The desktop's monospace font and colour scheme, or ones of its own</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.sachesi.tangent.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/sachesi/tangent</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/sachesi/tangent/issues</url>
